cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Fly-By-Wire"
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the FlyWire connectome paper and this repository."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ramasubramanian
    given-names: Siddaarth
    email: siddaarth.rs@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/siddaarthrms/Fly-By-Wire"
url: "https://github.com/siddaarthrms/Fly-By-Wire"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - connectome
  - flywire
  - drosophila
  - carla
  - computational-neuroscience
  - retinotopy
abstract: >-
  Fly-By-Wire: a fruit fly connectome autonomously driving a car. A 30×30
  artificial retina and synapse-weighted sums (~1,555 FLOPs/frame) control a
  CARLA vehicle. No neural network is trained at inference time.
